# Copying this file does not create encryption credentials.
#
# For AES-GCM development, build Coldkeep and run `./coldkeep init`; that
# command generates a private `.env` with fresh key material. Never commit the
# generated `.env`, and never reuse development credentials in production.
COLDKEEP_CODEC="plain"

# COLDKEEP_KEY is intentionally absent. Do not place a shared active key here.
